          "pageUri": "pages/section-VVxywlf3Jt",
          "reference": {
            "text": "In my browser, the scroll bar for the index is so thin that I can’t use it at all. Is there any way for you to make it bigger?  The index is basically unusable.  I have to use a down arrow to access it. Andrius",
            "type": "text"
