      ],
      "content": "\n\n<formula id=\"f-zKO-AbZXDS\">Daniel Ari Friedman</formula> In my browser, the scroll bar for the index is so thin that I can’t use it at all. Is there any way for you to make it bigger?  The index is basically unusable.  I have to use a down arrow to access it. Andrius\n\n\n\n<formula id=\"f-s63qevzxMW\">Daniel Ari Friedman</formula> I tried to submit my request above to the Requests page. But I didn’t find a way to submit it until I added a comment, at which point a Send button appeared. Then I sent it out but I never saw where it ended up. That functionality seems unusable and it seems better to me just to have a free form page for requests. Andrius.",
